# The gate-script test toolchain (scripts/BUILD.bazel) — the one input
# `scripts/requirements.lock` is compiled from. pytest runs
# test_telemetry_names.py; pyyaml is what the bazel-cache-rc selftest.sh parses
# action.yml with. Regenerate the lock with the command in its header
# (Renovate runs the same command through its pip-compile manager).
pytest
pyyaml
